{"title":"Welcome to Dallas","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Welcome to Dallas"},"headingText":"Getting Started","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"welcome-hero\">\n  <div class=\"welcome-hero-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"welcome-copy\">\n\n      <h1>Welcome to Dallas</h1>\n\n      <p class=\"welcome-intro\">\n        Welcome to PMG's Graduate Leadership Program! This guide is designed to\n        help you prepare for your move to Dallas and make your transition as\n        smooth as possible. Use the navigation above to explore neighborhoods,\n        apartment recommendations, transportation, Texas requirements, and tips\n        from fellow PMGers.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"welcome-meta\">\n\n        <div class=\"welcome-meta-item\">\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-label\">Office</span>\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-value\">\n            PMG Headquarters<br>\n            2601 Olive St, Floor 19<br>\n            Dallas, TX 75201\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"welcome-meta-item\">\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-label\">Program Start</span>\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-value\">\n            June 7, 2027\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"welcome-map\">\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=2601+Olive+St+Dallas+TX+75201\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n      >\n        <img\n          src=\"images/map.png\"\n          alt=\"PMG Dallas Office\"\n        >\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n::: {.section-light}\n\n\nChoose a topic below to get started.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"home-grid\">\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"neighborhoods.html\">\n<h3>🏙️ Neighborhoods</h3>\n<p>Compare Dallas neighborhoods, commute times, and average rent.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"apartments.html\">\n<h3>🏢 Apartments</h3>\n<p>Apartment search tools, move-in specials, utilities, parking, and fees.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"transportation.html\">\n<h3>🚗 Transportation</h3>\n<p>Learn about highways, DART, TollTags, and Dallas airports.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"dallas-basics.html\">\n<h3>📋 Texas Basics</h3>\n<p>Weather, driver's license, registration, inspections, and insurance.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"recommendations.html\">\n<h3>⭐ PMGer Recommendations</h3>\n<p>Browse restaurants, apartments, gyms, coffee shops, and more from fellow PMGers.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"resources.html\">\n<h3>📚 Resources</h3>\n<p>Helpful links, onboarding checklist, and moving resources.</p>\n</a>\n\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.section-dark}\n\n# Your First Week\n\n- Find an apartment\n- Set up utilities\n- Order an NTTA TollTag\n- Download the DART GoPass app\n- Visit the PMG office\n- Complete your onboarding tasks\n\n:::\n\n::: {.section-light}\n\n# Office Information\n\n| Item | Information |\n|------|-------------|\n| Address | 2601 Olive Street, Floor 19 |\n| City | Dallas, TX 75201 |\n| Neighborhood | Uptown |\n| Nearby | Katy Trail, Klyde Warren Park, McKinney Ave |\n\n:::","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"welcome-hero\">\n  <div class=\"welcome-hero-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"welcome-copy\">\n\n      <h1>Welcome to Dallas</h1>\n\n      <p class=\"welcome-intro\">\n        Welcome to PMG's Graduate Leadership Program! This guide is designed to\n        help you prepare for your move to Dallas and make your transition as\n        smooth as possible. Use the navigation above to explore neighborhoods,\n        apartment recommendations, transportation, Texas requirements, and tips\n        from fellow PMGers.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"welcome-meta\">\n\n        <div class=\"welcome-meta-item\">\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-label\">Office</span>\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-value\">\n            PMG Headquarters<br>\n            2601 Olive St, Floor 19<br>\n            Dallas, TX 75201\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"welcome-meta-item\">\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-label\">Program Start</span>\n          <span class=\"welcome-meta-value\">\n            June 7, 2027\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"welcome-map\">\n      <a\n        href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=2601+Olive+St+Dallas+TX+75201\"\n        target=\"_blank\"\n      >\n        <img\n          src=\"images/map.png\"\n          alt=\"PMG Dallas Office\"\n        >\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n::: {.section-light}\n\n# Getting Started\n\nChoose a topic below to get started.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"home-grid\">\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"neighborhoods.html\">\n<h3>🏙️ Neighborhoods</h3>\n<p>Compare Dallas neighborhoods, commute times, and average rent.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"apartments.html\">\n<h3>🏢 Apartments</h3>\n<p>Apartment search tools, move-in specials, utilities, parking, and fees.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"transportation.html\">\n<h3>🚗 Transportation</h3>\n<p>Learn about highways, DART, TollTags, and Dallas airports.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"dallas-basics.html\">\n<h3>📋 Texas Basics</h3>\n<p>Weather, driver's license, registration, inspections, and insurance.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"recommendations.html\">\n<h3>⭐ PMGer Recommendations</h3>\n<p>Browse restaurants, apartments, gyms, coffee shops, and more from fellow PMGers.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"home-card\" href=\"resources.html\">\n<h3>📚 Resources</h3>\n<p>Helpful links, onboarding checklist, and moving resources.</p>\n</a>\n\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.section-dark}\n\n# Your First Week\n\n- Find an apartment\n- Set up utilities\n- Order an NTTA TollTag\n- Download the DART GoPass app\n- Visit the PMG office\n- Complete your onboarding tasks\n\n:::\n\n::: {.s